WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
[Soft instrumental music]
Which button do I press? Ingane shows the next button on your remote.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:10.800
Choose a photo, say or type the task, and select a guide language.
The example asks how to unmute the TV.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:17.800
In the HDMI 2 practice guide, the highlight points to SOURCE.
Zoom in to see the button and confirm what appears on the TV.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:23.300
Copy the practice guide, select HDMI 2 and Malayalam,
and name the copy “Amma, switch to HDMI 2”.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:28.200
Add Malayalam narration to each step or record your own voice.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.800
The creator makes a read-only copy and chooses Share on WhatsApp.
Anyone who has the link can open it.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.940
Amma opens the guide on her phone and taps to listen.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.720
[Malayalam narration] Press SOURCE once.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:39.900
The written instruction stays on screen.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:45.300
Amma confirms each step and selects HDMI 2.
She can pause for help if her screen looks different.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.000
Done. Try the HDMI 2 guide at ingane.vercel.app.
